  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focused Surveillance Strategy and DTIR to support the national goal of Malaria Elimination - Honduras (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Honduras, Malaria, GLOBAL COMMUNITIES, INC. (GC Honduras)This program has the following goals: Alcanzar la eliminaci&#xf3;n de la malaria en el pa&#xed;s / Achieving malaria elimination in the country. The objectives of this program are: Lograr el acceso universal a la prevenci&#xf3;n, el diagn&#xf3;stico y el tratamiento de la malaria. / Achieve universal access to malaria prevention, diagnosis and treatment..  Fortalecer las acciones de la estrategia  del DTIR garantizando la detecci&#xf3;n y diagn&#xf3;stico oportuno y el tratamiento completo as&#xed; como la respuesta a casos /   Strengthen the actions of the D-TSR strategy by ensuring timely detection and diagnosis and complete treatment and response to cases.</narrative>
  </description>
